hadiths[37]{hadithnumber,text}:
"394","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne sahaba ko khushkhabri dete, farmate: 'Tumhare paas Ramazan aaya hai, mubarak mahina. Allah ne tum par us ka roza farz kiya hai. Us mein jannat ke darwaze khole jate hain, aur us mein jahim ke darwaze band kiye jate hain, aur us mein shayateen jakad diye jate hain. Us mein ek raat hai jo hazaar mahinon se behtar hai. Jo us ki khair se mahrum hua to tehqeeq woh mahrum hua.'"
"395","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Tehqeeq tumhare paas Ramazan aaya hai, mubarak mahina' — phir unhon ne isi ki misl zikr ki."
"396","[AI-translation] Abu Usman Nahdi se riwayat hai ke Abu Hurairah safar mein the. To woh ek manzil mein utre, to unhon ne un ki taraf qasid bheja jabke woh namaz padh rahe the taake khae. To unhon ne qasid se kaha: Beshak main rozedar hun. Phir jab khana rakha gaya aur woh farigh hone ke qareeb hue to woh khane lage. To unhon ne apne qasid ki taraf dekha, to us ne kaha: Us ne mujhe bataya tha ke woh rozedar hai. To Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Us ne sach kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Sabr ke mahine ka roza, aur har mahine teen din ke roze (poore) zamane ke roze hain.' To tehqeeq main ne mahine ke teen roze rakh liye; to main Allah ki takhfeef mein roza kholne wala hun aur Allah ki taz'eef mein roza rakhne wala hun."
"397","[AI-translation] Abu Usman Nahdi se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah ki saat (din) mehmani ki. Aur woh, un ki biwi aur un ka khadim raat mein teesre hisse mein bari lagate, yeh khada hota aur yeh sota, aur yeh khada hota aur yeh sota. Aur main ne Abu Hurairah ko kahte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khajooren taqseem farmain to mujhe saat khajooren milin. Un mein ek kharab khushk khajoor thi; koi cheez mujhe us se ziyada mahboob na thi; us ne mere chabane ko mazboot kiya. Sulaiman ne kaha: Yani us mein quwwat thi. Rawi ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Aey Abu Hurairah, tum mahine mein kaise roza rakhte ho? To unhon ne kaha: Main mahine ke awwal mein teen roze rakhta hun; phir agar mujhe koi hadsa pesh aae to mere liye mere mahine ka ajr hai."
"398","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne roze mein bhool kar khae ya piye, to use chahiye ke apna roza poora kare. Kyunke use sirf Allah ne khilaya aur pilaya hai."
"399","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo bhool kar khae ya bhool kar piye to use chahiye ke apna roza poora kare. Kyunke use sirf Allah ne khilaya aur pilaya hai.'"
"400","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Chaand dekh kar roza rakho aur chaand dekh kar roza kholo. Ya Aap ne farmaya: Jab use dekho to roza rakho aur jab use dekho to roza kholo. Phir agar tum par badal chha jae to tees gino."
"401","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum chaand dekho to roza rakho. Aur jab use dekho to roza kholo. Phir agar tum par badal chha jae to tees gino.'"
"402","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya — phir unhon ne isi ki misl zikr ki, aur kaha: Phir agar tum par badal chha jae."
"403","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah farmata hai: Aey Adam ke bete! Har amal kaffara hai siwae roze ke; woh mere liye hai aur main is ki jaza dunga. Aur rozedar ke munh ki bu Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushbu se ziyada pakeeza hai."
"404","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki manind bayan ki."
"405","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Wisal se bacho, wisal se bacho, wisal se bacho.' Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! To beshak Aap wisal farmate hain. Aap ne farmaya: 'To beshak tum is mein mere misl nahin ho. Beshak main raat guzarta hun jabke mera Rabb mujhe khilata aur pilata hai. To a'mal mein se utna karo jitni tum taqat rakhte ho.'"
"406","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo Ramazan ka ek roza baghair ruksat ke khol de to use poore zamane ka roza kafi nahin hoga agarche woh use rakhe.'"
"407","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo Ramazan ka ek roza baghair us ruksat ke khol de jo Allah ne di hai to use poore zamane ka roza kaffara nahin hoga agarche woh use rakhe.'"
"408","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai. Aap ne farmaya: 'Baghair beemari aur ruksat ke.'"
"409","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo Ramazan ka ek roza baghair us ruksat ke khol de jo Allah Ta'ala ne di hai to use poore zamane ka roza qaza nahin karega.'"
"410","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se marfoo'an riwayat hai ke Aap se poocha gaya: Farz namaz ke baad kaun si namaz afzal hai? Aur Ramazan ke mahine ke roze ke baad kaun sa roza afzal hai? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Farz namaz ke baad afzal namaz aadmi ki raat ke darmiyan mein namaz hai, aur Ramazan ke mahine ke baad afzal roza Allah ka mahina, Muharram hai.'"
"411","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Farz ke baad afzal namaz raat ki namaz hai, aur Ramazan ke mahine ke baad afzal roza Allah ka mahina, Muharram hai.'"
"412","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Adil imam ki dua radd nahin hoti.'"
"413","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se koi na kahe: Beshak main ne Ramazan ke roze rakhe.'"
"414","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Bakrah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se koi na kahe: Beshak main ne poore Ramazan ke roze rakhe aur poore mein qiyam kiya.' Rawi ne kaha: To main nahin janta Aap ne tazkiya ko napasand farmaya ya nahin? Aap ne farmaya: Sona ya ghaflat zaroori hai."
"415","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo Lailatul Qadr mein Allah par iman rakhte hue aur us ki tasdeeq karte hue qiyam kare us ke guzishta gunah bakhsh diye jate hain.'"
"416","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai, aur izafa kiya: Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhara roza us din hai jis din tum roza rakhte ho, aur tumhara fitr us din hai jis din tum roza kholte ho.'"
"417","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak Juma ka din eid ka din hai. To apne eid ke din ko apne roze ka din na banao, siwae is ke ke us se pahle ya us ke baad roza rakho.'"
"418","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Juma ke din roza na rakho siwae is ke ke use roze se milao.' Ishaq ne kaha: Aur woh aadmi Ziyad Harisi Abul Aubar hai; aise hi Jareer aur Mu'tamir ne kaha."
"419","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Rozedar ke munh ki bu Qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushbu se ziyada pakeeza hai.'"
"420","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rabi' bint Mu'az bin Afra (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ashura ki subah Ansar ki bastiyon ki taraf paigham bheja aur farmaya: 'Tum mein se jo subah rozedar utha ho to use chahiye ke apna roza poora kare. Aur tum mein se jo subah roza khole hue utha ho to use chahiye ke apne din ke baqi hisse mein roza rakhe.'"
"421","[AI-translation] Un ki phuphi (Khubaib bin Abdur Rahman) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Beshak Bilal raat mein azan kahta hai, ya Ibn Umm Maktum raat mein azan kahta hai. To khao yahan tak ke Ibn Umm Kulsum ya Bilal ki azan suno.' Aur un donon ke darmiyan siwae is ke kuch na tha ke yeh utarta aur yeh chadhta. Unhon ne kaha: Lekin ham un se kahte: Thehro yahan tak ke ham sehri kar len."
"422","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Hani' se riwayat hai — aur woh un ki (Ja'dah) phuphi hain — To main ne kaha: Tum ne yeh hadees kis se suni hai? To unhon ne kaha: Hamare ghar walon se. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas tashreef laae — mera khayal hai unhon ne kaha: Fath Makkah ke din — to main ne Aap ko sharbat pesh kiya ya Aap ko pesh kiya gaya aur Aap ne use piya. Phir Aap ne use mujhe diya. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main rozedar hun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Nafl rozedar ameer hai ya apne nafs par ameer hai. Phir agar tum chaho to roza rakho; aur agar tum chaho to roza kholo.'"
"423","[AI-translation] Un ki walida (Umar bin Khaldah Ansari) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Tashreeq ke dinon mein Ali ko bheja, to unhon ne elan kiya: Ke yeh khane, peene, aur jimak — yani nikah ke din hain."
"424","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Fadl se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Arafah ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf doodh bheja jabke Aap khutba de rahe the, to Aap ne use piya."
"425","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ramazan mein safar farmaya. To Aap ne Usfan tak roza rakha. Phir Aap ne bartan mangwaya jis mein sharbat tha, to use din mein piya taake log Aap ko dekhen. Phir Aap ne roza khola, yahan tak ke Makkah dakhil hue. Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne safar mein roza rakha aur roza khola. To jo chahe roza rakhe, aur jo chahe roza khole."
"426","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ham safar mein roza rakhne wale par aib nahin lagate, aur na roza kholne wale par. Waki' ne izafa kiya: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne safar mein roza rakha aur roza khola."
"427","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Beshak ham, nabiyon ki jama'at, hamen hukm diya gaya hai ke ham iftar mein jaldi karen, aur sehri mein takheer karen, aur ke ham namaz mein apne dayen se apne baen ko pakden."
"428","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Beshak meri walida faut ho gayin aur un par mahine ke roze hain. To kya main un ki taraf se qaza karun? Aap ne farmaya: Batao agar tumhari walida par qarz hota to kya tum use ada karte? To us ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: To Allah ka qarz us se ada kiye jane ka ziyada haqdar hai. Sulaiman ne kaha: To Hakam aur Salamah bin Kuhail ne kaha — jabke ham sab baithe the jab Muslim ne yeh hadees bayan ki — to un donon ne kaha: Ham ne Mujahid ko Ibn Abbas se woh zikr karte suna."
"429","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"430","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ki misl riwayat hai. Aur unhon ne kaha: Us ne un ki taraf se qaza kiya."
